---
import InfoPage from '../components/InfoPage.astro';
---

<InfoPage
	title="Privacy"
	description="Understand how YBS handles tool input, website requests, and external links."
	canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
	<h2>Tool input</h2>
	<p>YBS tools are designed to process text and files locally in your browser unless a tool clearly states otherwise. The currently available tools do not upload their working input to a YBS backend.</p>

	<h2>Website operations</h2>
	<p>Like most websites, the hosting platform may process basic request information such as IP address, browser details, requested URL, and timestamps for delivery, security, and reliability.</p>

	<h2>Local downloads and clipboard access</h2>
	<p>Copy and download actions use browser APIs. Your browser controls clipboard permissions and creates requested files on your device.</p>

	<h2>External destinations</h2>
	<p>External links are governed by the privacy practices of their destination. Review those practices before providing personal information.</p>

	<h2>Questions</h2>
	<p>Contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@ybs.tools">hello@ybs.tools</a> with privacy questions.</p>
</InfoPage>
